---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About LinkWA – Free WhatsApp Link Generator" description="LinkWA is a free WhatsApp link generator built for businesses that run on WhatsApp. No account, no data stored, no cost.">
<div class="container" style="max-width:680px;padding-top:4rem;padding-bottom:5rem;">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About LinkWA</h1>
    <p>LinkWA is a free WhatsApp click-to-chat link generator built for businesses, freelancers, and individuals who use WhatsApp as their primary customer communication channel.</p>
    <h2>Why we built this</h2>
    <p>Most WhatsApp link generators are slow, outdated, covered in ads, and missing features that modern businesses actually need — like UTM tracking, multi-number support, and proper QR code downloads.</p>
    <p>LinkWA fixes all of that. It is fast, clean, works on any device, and adds features like live chat preview and downloadable branded QR codes that help businesses look professional.</p>
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p>Everything runs in your browser. When you enter your phone number and click Generate, the link is built using JavaScript on your device. Nothing is sent to our servers. Your number is never logged or stored.</p>
    <h2>Who it is for</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Small business owners who want customers to reach them on WhatsApp</li>
      <li>Marketing teams running WhatsApp-based ad campaigns</li>
      <li>Freelancers adding a WhatsApp link to their Instagram bio</li>
      <li>Restaurants, shops, and clinics wanting a QR code for walk-in customers</li>
      <li>Agencies managing multiple client WhatsApp numbers</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Free, forever</h2>
    <p>LinkWA is and will always be free. We earn through non-intrusive display advertising. Your data is never monetised.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</Base>
